<pre><code>test('justAnotherAsyncAwait', () =&gt; {
  // return the Promise
  return expect(justAnotherAsyncAwait()).resolves.toBe('HIIII');  // Success!
});
</code></pre>

<p>...or use an <code>async</code> test function and call <code>await</code> on the <code>Promise</code>:</p>

<pre><code>test('justAnotherAsyncAwait', async () =&gt; {  // &lt;= async test function
  // await the Promise
  await expect(justAnotherAsyncAwait()).resolves.toBe('HIIII');  // Success!
});
</code></pre>

