Q: jQuery: Validating fields before submitting (multistep form)
A: <p>There's a very neat setting of jQuery validate that lets you ignore validation on hidden fields.  So you can handle the show/hide logic of your steps and for validation you could just do this:</p>

<p>As this suggests: <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2623514/jquery-validate-ignore-elements-with-style">ignore hidden</a></p>

<pre><code>$("form").validate({
   ignore: ":hidden"
});
